elektronen (gewone alkylgroep): rechts, lage δ.","size":13,"color":"#047857"},"t17":{"id":"t17","x":0,"y":420,"text":"• Aromatisch 6,5 tot 8; vinylisch 4,5 tot 6; aldehyde 9 tot 10; carbonzuur 10 tot 12 ppm.","size":13,"color":"#047857"},"t18":{"id":"t18","x":0,"y":481,"text":"3. Gelijkwaardige protonen en de integraal","bold":true,"size":19,"color":"#1d4ed8"},"t19":{"id":"t19","x":0,"y":509,"text":"Hoeveel signalen zie je, en hoeveel H zit er in elk signaal? H-atomen met precies dezelfde omgeving geven","size":13,"italic":true},"t20":{"id":"t20","x":0,"y":528,"text":"samen één signaal. De oppervlakte van dat signaal vertelt hoeveel H het zijn.","size":13,"italic":true},"t21":{"id":"t21","x":0,"y":557,"text":"Onthoud","bold":true,"size":13,"color":"#047857"},"t22":{"id":"t22","x":0,"y":576,"text":"• Aantal signalen = aantal sets gelijkwaardige H.","size":13,"color":"#047857"},"t23":{"id":"t23","x":0,"y":595,"text":"• Integraal = verhouding van het aantal H per signaal.","size":13,"color":"#047857"},"t24":{"id":"t24","x":0,"y":614,"text":"• Twee H op hetzelfde C kunnen toch verschillen (cis/trans, dia 13).","size":13,"color":"#047857"},"t25":{"id":"t25","x":0,"y":649,"text":"Hoeveel signalen? (dia 12). gelijke letters = gelijkwaardige H","size":13,"bold":false},"t26":{"id":"t26","text":"a","x":34.95,"y":761.39,"color":"#d64545","bold":true,"size":13},"t27":{"id":"t27","text":"a","x":145.85,"y":761.86,"color":"#d64545","bold":true,"size":13},"t28":{"id":"t28","text":"methoxymethaan","x":50.6,"y":793,"color":"#555555","italic":true,"size":12},"t29":{"id":"t29","text":"a","x":315.88,"y":761.71,"color":"#d64545","bold":true,"size":13},"t30":{"id":"t30","text":"b","x":260.5,"y":705.7,"color":"#d64545","bold":true,"size":13},"t31":{"id":"t31","text":"chloorethaan","x":226.8,"y":793,"color":"#555555","italic":true,"size":12},"t32":{"id":"t32","text":"a","x":503.29,"y":721.02,"color":"#d64545","bold":true,"size":13},"t33":{"id":"t33","text":"b","x":413.26,"y":709,"color":"#d